;; Maintenance x body constants (found by M4N slice 3, latent since M1):
;; a keyed delta-index probe driver never drains within a maintenance
;; epoch, so a constant-bearing body clause used as a version's driver
;; re-fired forever.  Drivers now lift constants to full-shape scans
;; (lift-driver-consts) and the seal refuses probe drivers under
;; maintenance flavors.

table (a int)
table (p int int)
table (h int)
rule (a X) (p 1 X) --> (h X)
